@startuml
title UML sequence behaviour — Transform a password
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
participant "Caller (IdentityService or seed)" as caller
box "Backend — Application and Domain" #ECFDF3
  participant "passwordTransform" as pw
end box
caller -> pw : transform(plain)
pw -> pw : Encode UTF-8 bytes
pw -> pw : SHA-256 digest, no salt (L2-015 criterion 1)
pw -> pw : Base64 encode
pw --> caller : Stored-form password
note right of pw : Same input gives the same output (L2-015 criterion 2)
@enduml
